/target
.DS_Store

# Dependency trees and build output, at the ROOT so they apply on every branch.
#
# These rules lived in `ts/.gitignore`, and `ts/` exists only on the TypeScript verifier's branch.
# Switching away from that branch left its `node_modules` in the working tree as untracked files —
# changing branches does not remove untracked files — no rule here covered them, and `git add -A`
# committed 783 vendored files and 30 generated ones onto a branch with no TypeScript source, from
# where they reached main. A branch-local ignore rule cannot cover an artefact that appears on other
# branches (E-11 review, S9-E11-08).
node_modules/
ts/dist/
